  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Initial Layout**\n\nI\'ve decided this background component is fantastic. Now, I\'m focusing on building the layout\'s other structures. The immediate need: a navigation bar. It\'ll feature \"GAME.RAMULAB\" as the home button, always resetting to \"About me.\" The top right will house tabs: \"About me,\" \"Video games,\" and \"TTR\".\n\n\n**Designing Content Sections**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the content panels. I\'m structuring \"About me\" to hold identity details, network links with copy features, and direct links to Discord and Steam. \"Video games\" will have Steam, Riot, and Minecraft server information. Finally, \"TTRPG\" is for Foundry VTT and Discord group links, including a schedule. A dynamic owner settings panel is also under consideration.\n\n\n**Adding Admin Panel Functionality**\n\nI\'m now fully committed to making this a dynamic application! The plan is to include an \"Admin Panel\" with a cyberpunk aesthetic. This panel will let the user update all the key information directly, which will then be saved to `localStorage`. I\'m going to structure it for ease of use. It should reset to defaults as well. I\'m focusing on making it extremely practical. Also, I\'m organizing the tabs now as React components!\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create the `/src/components/AboutTab.tsx` component. It implements a beautiful Bento-grid layout that represents the user\'s gamer bio, custom statistics, and social links (Steam connectivity, Discord Server joining, and a click-to-copy Discord ID button with user feedback animation)."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 831055399
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
