    thinking: "**Designing the Panel**\n\nI\'m incredibly excited about this! Now I\'m focused on building the Owner Settings/Admin Customizer Panel. My vision is a visually stunning modal or slide-over drawer, beautifully styled with deep cyber-neon vibes. I\'m imagining this taking shape in `/src/components/AdminPanel`.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create the custom `/src/components/AdminPanel.tsx` component. This serves as an interactive Customizer/Settings Panel styled like a cyberpunk diagnostic console. It allows you to:\n1. Live-edit all the card fields (Discord tags, Steam profiles, Minecraft IPs, VTT links).\n2. Save configurations locally in your browser (`localStorage`).\n3. Instantly reset keys back to their original default states via one click. This keeps the application highly practical and customizable."
